<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · site</p><h1 class="enc-title">Tetitla</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Tetitla is an elite apartment compound on the western side of Teotihuacan, notable for its many rooms decorated with murals. Its paintings include figures of the female deity often called the Great Goddess, jaguars, priests casting offerings and some motifs in a Maya style. Its rich wall paintings illustrate the religion and art of the city in its later centuries.</p></div>
